WEBVTT

00:02.567 --> 00:05.567
Every meeting you record becomes something you can ask.

00:06.333 --> 00:09.667
Select lines in the transcript and ask about them, during the meeting.

00:10.433 --> 00:14.633
Or ask a whole project: what was agreed about the tail shaft survey, and when?

00:15.400 --> 00:18.300
The answer comes with the meeting and the line it came from.
